· Complementarity: s_{12} = K_1^L \cdot m_{LR} \cdot K_2^R + K_1^R \cdot m_{RL} \cdot K_2^L = 10 \cdot 0.3 \cdot 8 + 2 \cdot 0.3 \cdot 3 = 24 + 1.8 = 25.8

Coalition Values (at full cooperation c = (1,1)):

V(\{1\}) = 12, \quad V(\{2\}) = 11, \quad V(\{1,2\}) = 12 + 11 + 25.8 = 48.8.

Shapley Value:

\varphi_1 = \frac{V(\{1\}) + V(\{1,2\}) - V(\{2\})}{2} = \frac{12 + 37.8}{2} = 24.9,

